  "details": "It would be really nice to be able to regroup with a portal you can drop to friends instance. I cant tell you how many times me and my friends have to individually join and wait for the social tab to update just to join each other.  Another thing that happens a lot is when my friend isn't friends with a person I want to join and has to wait for the social tab to update. I really think a \"Drop portal to instance\" button would be a great feature to be implemented.",
